+
+- `calcuis-diffusion` — LoaderGGUF, LoaderGGUFAdvanced: an opaque `ModelRef` selecting the Calcuis loader.
+- `calcuis-text` — ClipLoaderGGUF, DualClipLoaderGGUF, TripleClipLoaderGGUF, QuadrupleClipLoaderGGUF.
